<title>USA: DuPont Co Q3 net, share rise.</title>
<headline>DuPont Co Q3 net, share rise.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.60		    $1.38</p>
<p> Net		 898,000		  769,000</p>
<p> Sales	     10,486,000	     10,200,000</p>
<p>	  NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $4.95		    $4.47</p>
<p> Net		 2,778,000		2,666,000</p>
<p> Sales	     32,403,000	     31,778,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Earnings per share for the third quarter of 1996 includes a nonrecurring charge of $0.08.  </p>
<p>NOTE: Figures from the third quarter of 1995 include a $0.12 per share income from insurance recoveries related to environmental remediation.</p>
